OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright day with sunny spells
OL,6,Fand a few showers, which could be
OL,7,Fquite frequent in the morning, and
OL,8,Fheavy in the west. Fresh to strong
OL,9,Fwest or southwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells and scattered
OL,12,Fshowers in the evening, occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy in the west. Turning mostly dry
OL,14,Fovernight as showers become lighter
OL,15,Fand more isolated. Fresh to strong
OL,16,Fwinds gradually ease.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
