OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMostly dry and bright with
OL,6,Fgood sunny spells, but somewhat
OL,7,Fcloudier in the afternoon with the
OL,8,Fchance of the odd shower. Fresh winds
OL,9,Fat first will soon become light.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,12,Fwith some rain Sunday morning and
OL,13,Fagain later in the day. Bright start
OL,14,FMonday then increasingly heavy showers
OL,15,Fand blustery winds. Windy Tuesday with
OL,16,Foccasionally heavy rain or showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
